WEBVTT

00:00:27.143 --> 00:00:33.083
and it deserves not to be deemed
anything but a pernicious sickness."

00:00:33.687 --> 00:00:38.713
That's from "Time" magazine in 1966,
when I was three years old.

00:00:39.215 --> 00:00:42.719
And last year, the president
of the United States

00:00:42.743 --> 00:00:45.406
came out in favor of gay marriage.

00:00:45.992 --> 00:00:52.956
(Applause)

00:00:53.488 --> 00:00:55.045
And my question is:

00:00:55.069 --> 00:00:58.625
How did we get from there to here?

00:00:58.649 --> 00:01:02.711
How did an illness become an identity?